---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="锦乃｜二代目试制江户城｜WORKS"
  description=""
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

<picture>
  <source
    media="(max-width: 768px)"
    srcset="/images/nishikino-edo2-mobile.jpg"
  />

  <img
    src="/images/nishikino-edo2.jpg"
    alt="二代目试制江户城"
    class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />
</picture>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

<div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

  <p
    class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
    style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
  >
    SECOND PROTOTYPE OF EDO CASTLE
  </p>

  <h1
    class="mt-1 text-[36px] leading-[1.15] text-white"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    二代目试制江户城
  </h1>

  <p
    class="mt-6 text-xl text-white"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    “忠实再现实物形态”的下一次挑战。
  </p>

  <div class="mt-12 flex items-center">

    <div class="h-[1px] w-[360px] bg-[#caa14d]"></div>

  </div>

</div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- Introduction -->
<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概述
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        在初代试制江户城的制作过程中积累了城郭结构方面的认识后，我以忠实再现实物形态为目标，向“第二阶段”发起了挑战。<br>
        本作制作于我中学生时期，是我追求更加精细、更加真实的江户城形态过程中迈出的新一步。
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于二代目试制江户城
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

        在完成“初代试制江户城”的制作后，我作为下一次挑战所着手制作的第二阶段作品。

        <br><br>

        初代作品最初是从生存模式据点逐步扩建而成，最终演变为以皇居东御苑为依据的结构；而本作从一开始便以“忠实再现实物形态”为目标正式展开制作。

        <br><br>

        本作是在我中学生时期制作的作品。我采用了更加精密的制作方式，不仅还原了本丸、二之丸等曲轮的布局，也进一步将石垣的走向等实物轮廓融入作品之中。

        <br><br>

        在以初代作品积累的经验为基础的同时，本作在尺度感、细部装饰以及区域布局的还原程度上都有了提升。

        <br><br>

        三之丸的轮廓尤其体现了这种还原度的提升。然而，由于我将本丸的轮廓制作成了直线，没能按照实物的斜向形态进行还原，导致二之丸的结构出现问题。再加上中间考试、期末考试以及高中升学考试接踵而至，最终停止了制作。

        <br><br>

        但这件作品象征着我从“制作属于自己的城堡”，转变为“准确地还原现实中曾经存在的江户城”的意识变化。它也是后来更加大型、更加精密的历史建筑复原项目之间的重要桥梁。

        <br><br>

        与初代试制江户城一同被妥善保存至今。

        </p>

      </div>

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">二代目试制江户城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式城郭</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建造时期</p>
              <p class="text-base">2018年3月～2018年11月</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                建筑保存用世界（试制原本：〒100-0001 东京都千代田区千代田一丁目1番）
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城时期</p>
              <p class="text-base">（试制原本：庆长年间～宽永年间）</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城者</p>
              <p class="text-base">锦乃（试制原本：德川将军家）</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">平城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">我的世界：Pocket Edition v1.1.0</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类别</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑・复原试作</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">未完成（保存于我的世界：Java Edition）</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

    <!-- Gallery -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>

     <div class="gallery mt-12">

  <div class="gallery-frame">
    <img
      src="/images/nishikino-edo2.png"
      alt="二代目试制江户城 全景"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-frame">
    <img
      src="/images/nishikino-edo2-1.png"
      alt="二代目试制江户城"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-frame">
    <img
      src="/images/nishikino-edo2-2.png"
      alt="二代目试制江户城 櫓与石垣"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-frame">
    <img
      src="/images/nishikino-edo2-3.png"
      alt="二代目试制江户城"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-frame">
    <img
      src="/images/nishikino-edo2-4.jpg"
      alt="二代目试制江户城"
    />
  </div>

</div>

</div>

    <div class="mt-24">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 查看WORKS中的其他作品
      </a>

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/nishikinoedocastle1/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 查看上一件作品
      </a>

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/edocastle/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        进入完成版 →
      </a>

       <!-- Share -->

      <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>

<script>
  const pageUrl = "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/nishikinoedocastle2/";

  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 二代目试制江户城 | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton = document.getElementById("x-share");
  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  if (xShareButton) {
    xShareButton.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );
  }

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {
        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";
        }, 2000);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(error);
    }
  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制本作品页面的URL后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
    const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
    const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();
    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      overlay?.remove();
    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        overlay.remove();
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

0%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
}

100%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

}

section{
position:relative;
}

section::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
position:sticky;
top:120px;
height:max-content;
}

a{
transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

section{
overflow:hidden;
}

}

@media(max-width:900px){

aside{
position:relative;
top:auto;
}

}

@media(max-width:768px){

section:first-child{
height:760px;
}

.work-hero{
animation:none;
}

}

@media(max-width:768px){

  .hero-overlay{
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(246,241,231,.85) 0%,
        rgba(246,241,231,.45) 55%,
        transparent 100%
      ) !important;
  }

}


.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>